### 1 cli query --workspace recognized | map(fn(r) => r.groups.name.text + " " + r.groups.number.text) --json
$ xmd query --workspace recognized | map(fn(r) => r.groups.name.text + " " + r.groups.number.text) --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
